# Default-deny: only the paths below can ever be committed.
# This project was developed in a working folder that also holds device logs,
# screenshots, adb helpers and private keys - none of that belongs on GitHub.
/*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!README.zh-CN.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!build.sh
!app/
!tools/

# Extra safety nets (applies inside app/ and tools/ too)
*.p12
*.keystore
*.jks
*.pk8
*.pem
*.apk
*.idsig
*.aar
build/
dist/
keystore/
.research/
.workbuddy/
*.log
